.TH "CSSMATHVALUE.OPERATOR" "3JS" "August 11, 2026" "JavaScript" "JavaScript Reference Manual"
.SH NAME
CSSMathValue.operator \- CSSMathValue: operator property
.SH SYNOPSIS
\f[B]Note:\f[R] This feature is available in Web Workers.
.PP
The \f[B]\f[CB]operator\f[B]\f[R] read\-only property of the
\f[CR]CSSMathValue\f[R] interface returns the operator that the current
subtype represents.
For example, if the current \f[CR]CSSMathValue\f[R] subtype is
\f[CR]CSSMathSum\f[R], this property will return the string
\f[CR]\(dqsum\(dq\f[R].
.SH VALUE
A \f[CR]String\f[R].
.PP
